[DOCUMENT]
TITLE: November 18 Mutation Findings Contracts

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: SPICE-VALIDATION-BOUNDARY-018
TITLE: Inclusive budgets and independent invalid operands
STATEMENT: >>>
Public validation shall accept the documented inclusive byte/count limits and
reject the next value. Nonfinite measurement-window endpoints and invalid
Newton/refinement tolerances shall each be rejected independently. Bounds
include element/measurement/assertion identifiers, generated case bases, hash
domains, grid dimensions, PWL points and FM frequency deviation.
<<<

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: SPICE-AUDIT-COMMONMODE-018
TITLE: Differential capacitor storage in trapezoidal audit
STATEMENT: >>>
The independent trapezoidal capacitor audit shall use the change in terminal
voltage difference, with current positive from P to N. Adding a constant common
potential shall not change capacitor current or the discrete energy identity.
A corrupted source-current state shall fail the audit.
<<<

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: SPICE-EXPRESSION-CHAIN-018
TITLE: Exponential composition derivatives
STATEMENT: >>>
The bounded expression evaluator shall apply the chain rule for exp(a*x),
including zero, negative and nonunit finite a. Analytic slopes shall agree with
independent central finite differences within explicitly recorded numerical
bounds on the selected finite test domain.
<<<

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: SPICE-NEWTON-EVIDENCE-018
TITLE: Dynamic convergence and damping evidence
STATEMENT: >>>
A stationary committed dynamic state shall require zero corrections. After a
nonzero update, dynamic acceptance shall require both residual and update
criteria. A full undamped linear correction shall not be reported as damped.
Line-search reference construction shall reject an incorrectly sized correction
even when the state and right-hand side dimensions are valid.
<<<

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: SPICE-MUTATION-INVALID-018
TITLE: Invalid generator shapes remain separate evidence
STATEMENT: >>>
Compile-invalid mutation replacements shall remain distinct from caught,
surviving, filtered and unattempted candidates. A pinned generator workaround
shall exclude only a reviewed invalid replacement shape, retain behavioral
operator mutations, and be included in source snapshot provenance. Tool
upgrades require requalification of the workaround.
<<<

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: SPICE-IMPORTED-TRAN-018
TITLE: Imported transient settings reach execution
STATEMENT: >>>
An accepted transient directive shall preserve its explicit stop time and
maximum step in the executable configured analysis. Default settings shall not
replace supplied values. Executing a single-point constant PWL voltage fixture
shall cover zero through the requested stop with increasing times, no accepted
step above the requested maximum and the analytically specified voltage.
<<<

